    <!-- Abstract -->
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="">
      <dc:description>
        The DSLO v0.8 Scientific Overview summarizes the federated geometry expansion of the DSLO
        discipline. v0.8 is strictly additive, geometry-only, and inherits exclusively from DSLO v0.7
        substrate and manifold lineage. It introduces federated geometry, domain-class geometry,
        invariant surfaces, mapping surfaces, registry anchors, and DSLO-native formatting surfaces
        required for collective thermodynamic geometry.
      </dc:description>
    </rdf:Description>

